  "title": "Open Secure AI Alliance: Tech Partners Join to Enhance AI Security",
  "summary": "The Open Secure AI Alliance, featuring Microsoft, SpaceX, IBM, and others, aims to address AI security risks directly responding to a recent cyberattack on Hugging Face. The initiative focuses on developing open-source AI security tools to defend against attacks from frontier models, while Microsoft introduces its first AI security model and a new agentic cybersecurity system.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Microsoft, SpaceX, IBM, and others have launched the Open Secure AI Alliance to address AI security risks.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The initiative aims to develop and share open-source AI security tools to defend against attacks from frontier models.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
